{"id":"fea1d98b554a6f24","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-cor-kunene-fodor.md","title":"Kunene–Fodor","display":"cor-kunene-fodor — Kunene–Fodor","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-kunene-fodor","aliases":["58-cor-kunene-fodor"],"display":"cor-kunene-fodor — Kunene–Fodor","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-kunene-fodor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-kunene-fodor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-kunene-fodor — Kunene–Fodor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3b01159c2b5601b\" href=\"?note=e3b01159c2b5601b\" title=\"../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md\">../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land f\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (stationary-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Regressive}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (regressive-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}kunene\\text{-}fodor}\\vdash\n\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\n\\to\n\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\xi\\in S\\mid f(\\xi)=\\alpha\\},\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}kunene\\text{-}fodor}\\vdash\n\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\n\\to\n\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\xi\\in S\\mid f(\\xi)=\\alpha\\},\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fodor's lemma holds for regressive functions on stationary subsets of regular uncountable cardinals.</li>\n<li>This is a cornerstone of combinatorial set theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md","status":"resolved","id":"e3b01159c2b5601b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-fodor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[..